s/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E8%8E%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94\" title=\"莫莉德尔\"><img alt=\"莫莉德尔\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E8%8E%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94\" title=\"莫莉德尔\">莫莉德尔</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.3</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>铁与高堡之歌</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：312103</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3121/312103/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">在普罗旺斯的夏季，薰衣草会汇成一片紫色的海洋。<br />薰衣草田的不远处，是戈尔德城堡。这座建立于11世纪的城堡，时至如今依然坚不可摧，能够庇护那些因为战火而无家可归的人。<br />莫莉德尔和亲如手足的“弟妹”们来到了这里。在离开了战场之后，他们终于越过硝烟，看清了世界原本的面貌。空气中的尖啸声不再来源于炸弹，而是来自急速上升之后又炸开的烟花。<br />只是战争的阴影依旧如影随形，一个人在习惯了某样事物之后，总是很难立即抽身。每到夜晚，莫莉德尔会检视城堡的各处，以保证它能够抵御可能的敌袭。<br />一遍，一遍，又一遍。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"312103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/88/Belonging-312104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“边陲的白羽”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Soaring Over the Steppe\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一副银质额饰。无论她如何调整姿态，它与皮肤都如原生般贴合。镌刻的纹路或许来自受访者家乡的草原。因为受访者曾无意间提及：“如果我会对什么有所触动，那一定是关于我生活过的地方。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/38/Belonging-312105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“无锈的证明”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Stainless Heart\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />18<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一套修理工具。笔者来访时，受访者正在打磨这套工具，根据其表面柔和的光泽推断，它们应该经常被使用。<br />在为我们展示时，受访者的衣物不慎擦落一柄工具。很显然，军队出身的她还不能很好地适应如此富有装饰性的衣物。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/Belonging-312106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“他乡叙事诗”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Reminder of Home\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一枚纯手工制造的勋章被装点成了胸针，纹章已经刻下了风沙的痕迹，与陪衬它的锦缎格格不入。<br />当我们提起它时——“一件旧物罢了。”受访者目光笃定。笔者知道这个话题结束了。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero312103_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero312103_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero312103_fight